Error [E3401]: `read_first` calls the impure function `term.stdin`
  --> tests/ui/stdin_pure_e3401.jet:5:18
    |
  5 |     handle :: io.stdin()
    |                  ^^^^^
 Why: `term.stdin` is impure, but `read_first` declares `-[]>`
 Fix: remove the call from `read_first`, or drop the `-[]>` bound from `read_first` so its effects are inferred
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E3401
